WEBVTT

00:00:29.526 --> 00:00:31.386
Buning ajablanarli yeri yo'q,

00:00:31.386 --> 00:00:34.843
chunki Trayveriken aslida og'riq 
qoldiruvchi vosita bo'lmagan,

00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:39.066
u umuman og'riq qoldiruvchi xususiyatga 
ega bo'lmagan "sohta eliksir" edi.

00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:43.073
Talabalarni sohta dorining 
kuchiga ishonishga nima undadi?

00:00:43.073 --> 00:00:45.842
Javob esa platsebo effektida, yetarlicha

00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:47.286
izohlanmagan fenomen bo'lib,

00:00:47.286 --> 00:00:51.840
unda ta'sir ko'rsatishi kutilmagan 
va ko'pincha sohta dorilar, muolajalar

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.405
va davolash usullari

00:00:53.405 --> 00:00:56.465
mo'jizaviy ravishda insonni 
oyoqqa turgizadi.

00:00:56.465 --> 00:01:00.496
Shifokorlar platsebo atamasini 
1700-yildan buyon, bemordagi simptomni